{"id":"b32b72be1ddf731a","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-rel-symmetric-closure-relation.md","title":"ZFC Rel Symmetric Closure Relation","display":"df-zfc-rel-symmetric-closure-relation — ZFC Rel Symmetric Closure Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-symmetric-closure-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-symmetric-closure-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-symmetric-closure-relation — ZFC Rel Symmetric Closure Relation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-symmetric-closure-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-symmetric-closure-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-symmetric-closure-relation — ZFC Rel Symmetric Closure Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,C\\in V\">\\(R,C\\in V\\)</span> are sets of ordered pairs and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{-1}\">\\(R^{-1}\\)</span> is defined below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelSymmetricClosureRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelSymmetricClosureRelation}_S\\)</span> is the two-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}inverse}\\vdash R^{-1}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}inverse}\\vdash R^{-1}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}closure\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelSymmetricClosureRelation}_S(C,R)\\leftrightarrow C=R\\cup R^{-1}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}closure\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelSymmetricClosureRelation}_S(C,R)\\leftrightarrow C=R\\cup R^{-1}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 及其所有反向边，是包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的最小对称关系。</li>\n<li>使用集合编码的关系，避免把真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^2\">\\(V^2\\)</span> 当作 ZFC 集合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelSymmetricClosureRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}inverse}\\vdash R^{-1}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}closure\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelSymmetricClosureRelation}_S(C,R)\\leftrightarrow C=R\\cup R^{-1}","display":true},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"V^2","display":false}],"bytes":1018,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3322","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-rel-symmetric-closure-relation.md|58-df-zfc-rel-symmetric-closure-relation]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}